5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually changed patient outcomes before adding more.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about whether the current infrastructure can absorb another program without seizing up.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Approval is easy; the real risk is when arrangements break in year two due to lack of commitment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to see the staffing records to understand where the pressure lands on clinical teams.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I need to know what this budget can actually build and what it will earn back.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you have data on where recent starts came apart?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, staffing pressure is key, but so is physical space and booking capacity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I have looked into the structural failures of past joint ventures.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I agree. Rosters are where every new program eventually lands, and teams rarely ask for it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@All, let us ensure we are not just voting for the idea, but for the sustainability.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the readmission figures and the booking system records.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will check the rooms, parking, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and data agreements.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will examine the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look into the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
